01.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"q2q13mtwjt57vfua0mo7tgb7t"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":"ybuomci2thehtjunkk4btqs46","title":"Anthropic IPO路演披露长期经营利润率目标为35%或以上","summary":"Anthropic 在 11 月 10 日公布的 IPO 路演视频中披露，公司计划通过提升算力效率、增加直接租赁芯片和数据中心比例、扩大推理业务占比，将长期调整后经营利润率目标提升至 35% 或以上。第三季度数据显示其经营利润率为 15%，计算与基础设施支出占比将从 58% 降至 45%-50%，销售及合作伙伴费用占比拟由 14% 降至 7%-10%，人员及其他运营费用占比同步优化。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2303577","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T01:40:53.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":"dzok4gtsisrgmgpgudo77f54v","title":"币安本周重新开放87条网络提现服务，计划下周末完成全部恢复","summary":"币安宣布本周已恢复87条网络提现服务，并计划在下周末前重新开放所有剩余网络及资产的提现功能。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a1d839-3d45-70f7-a763-1b2a03d5b9e0","publishedAt":"2026-11-14T04:03:15.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":"ksbq3l5q4m4f9t58ygf8bv304","title":"CoreWeave季度财报：收入超预期并上调全年指引，缓解AI放缓担忧","summary":"CoreWeave 2026年第三季度财报显示收入达$3.66亿超预期，并上调全年调整后运营收入指引至$1.275亿-$1.375亿。尽管公司宣布首期亚洲数据中心和Forge AI模型评估服务，但股价近月下跌超40%，因市场担忧AI投资放缓及Nvidia供应链风险。财报同时披露公司债务达$470亿，且主要客户Anthropic计划下周纳斯达克上市（估值或达$1.4万亿）。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-earnings-report-2026.html","publishedAt":"2026-11-10T21:25:35.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/8a38891190fe9c5746056cd9f910f6507b39931cc68aff10b5b7ba3ca1be11b3.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/3fa9d436c8291250715c22ef31328d4840f6e992f49d24ec46545d05558308cb.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/8a38891190fe9c5746056cd9f910f6507b39931cc68aff10b5b7ba3ca1be11b3.webp 96w","itemId":"kq6zy907c9sc2gwjgt5yxkeps","title":"Lyell Immunopharma 在 2026 Stifel 健康医疗会议上发布临床试验进展","summary":"Lyell Immunopharma 在 2026 Stifel 健康医疗会议上宣布其核心产品 ronde-cel 的两项关键临床试验进展：PiNACLE试验计划于明年提交BLA申请，另一项头对头随机对照试验将展示与YESCARTA、BREYANZI的疗效对比数据。","sourceName":"Seeking Alpha","sourceUrl":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4966624-lyell-immunopharma-inc-lyel-presents-at-stifel-2026-healthcare-conference-2026-transcript?source=feed_all_articles","publishedAt":"2026-11-11T18:39:34.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":"zadh9yvjpgq2unl8d4mhbzpjk","title":"思科第一财季营收185亿美元，同比增长24%，上调全年业绩预期","summary":"思科2027财年第一季度营收185.17亿美元，同比增长24%，净利润45.52亿美元，同比增长59%。公司上调全年营收预期至748亿至758亿美元，并预计AI基础设施业务收入将达90亿美元，较2026财年增长一倍以上。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://finance.eastmoney.com/news/1354,202611133930093620.html","publishedAt":"2026-11-12T23:11:10.000Z","firstParty":false,"av